  <section id="works">
    <h2>Works listed</h2>
    <p>
      The article lists “some of his works”. The Turkish translations in
      brackets are the article’s own, and the titles are Arabic written in
      Turkish letters. I haven’t seen the Arabic originals.
    </p>
    <ol>
      <li>
        <span lang="tr">“Elifba Şerkesiyye”</span> (Circassian Alphabet)
      </li>
      <li>
        <span lang="tr">“Eş’ar Şerkesiyye”</span> (Circassian Poems)
      </li>
      <li>
        <span lang="tr">“Tarih-i Şerakise minzulkadim ve haddel asrel hadis”</span>
        (History of the Circassians from the Past to the Present)
      </li>
      <li>
        <span lang="tr">“Eşşerakise fı hurubihim dıdal kayasera”</span> (The
        Circassians in Their Wars against the Tsars, Homs 1948)
      </li>
      <li>
        <span lang="tr">“Medhal ile tarih-i Şerakise”</span> (Introduction to
        Circassian History; published after his death, in the 1980s)
      </li>
    </ol>
